  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……千雪？\r\nそれ──何か作ってるのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、ブレスレットです\r\n今度の衣装に合わせようと思って",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか──\r\nあれ……違うデザインのが、ふたつあるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……あ、これは、\r\n甘奈ちゃんと甜花ちゃんのぶんなんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "この前、試作した自分用のものを見てもらったら\r\nとっても気に入ってくれたみたいだったので……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、そういうことか\r\n……きっとふたりとも喜ぶぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ\r\nそうだったら、嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんか、千雪が何かを作ってるところを見るの、\r\n久しぶりな気がするな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あれ、そうですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも……確かに、最近事務所では\r\nあまりしていなかった気がします",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ここのところ\r\n随分忙しくなったからな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……\r\n今日だってさ……疲れたりしてないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いえ、そんなこと……\r\nお気遣い、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも、そうですね……また体調を崩して\r\nご迷惑をおかけするわけにはいかないですよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや……迷惑だなんて思ってない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、千雪をサポートすることが俺の仕事なんだから\r\nそんなふうに言わないでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと、俺が言いたかったのは、そうだな………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頑張ってるつもりでも、それがいつの間にか\r\n無理に繋がってしまったりするだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからその、無理をすると\r\n…………楽しめないんじゃないかなと……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "──あ……\r\nえ、ええと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "この前の話……\r\n覚えていてくださって、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……はは\r\nいや……さ、やっぱり……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪には、この道を選んでよかった、って\r\n思ってもらいたいんだよ……いつでも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わ……\r\nそんな……う、嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………\r\nそれは、もちろん──",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "すべてが思い通りで、幸せに溢れていて……\r\nなんてわけにはいかないですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私、無理なんかはしてないんです\r\n好きなことを、好きなようにやっているだけで……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なので……\r\n私は元気だから大丈夫ですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………という返答では、いかがでしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきのことは、俺の杞憂だったみたいだな\r\n……忘れてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "い、いえ……！　忘れませんよっ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが……私のこと、\r\nちゃんと考えてくださってるってことですもん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おいおい……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………\r\n──よし、できた",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい、プロデューサーさん♪",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……\r\nこのブレスレット──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ、ちょっと可愛すぎますか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺までもらっちゃって、いいのか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もちろんですよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは、私の……\r\n私たちの、プロデューサーさんなんですから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600411/2016004110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう、千雪\r\n大切にするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016004110260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
